			"Message": "style(Mountain): Add blank lines between provider registration match arms in LanguageFeatures\n\nInsert blank-line separators between `register_signature_help_provider`, `register_code_lens_provider`, and `register_folding_range_provider` arms in `Source/Track/Effect/CreateEffectForRequest/LanguageFeatures.rs` to improve readability of the language-feature provider registration block.\n\nThis is a formatting-only change with no functional impact.",
